<view class="pageDemo"><mx-nav title="粘性吸附" /><view style="height:{{navHeight}}px;"></view><view class="demoIntro"><desc type="name" text="Sticky">Sticky</desc><desc>滚动时将内容吸附在指定位置，常用于吸顶导航、筛选栏等场景</desc></view><view class="tip">向下滚动页面，观察各区块吸顶效果。本页使用自定义导航栏，吸顶高度需避开导航区域。</view><wrap><title type="h2">基础用法</title><desc type="prop" text="top">top="{{navHeight}}px"</desc></wrap><view class="cons"><mx-sticky top="{{navHeight}}px"><view class="stickyBar">我会吸顶</view></mx-sticky><view class="block"><view class="blockItem" wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="*this" wx:if="{{index < 6}}">{{item}}</view></view></view><view class="sectionGap"></view><wrap><title type="h2">指定吸顶高度</title><desc type="prop" text="top">top 在导航高度基础上再偏移 48px</desc></wrap><view class="cons"><mx-sticky top="{{navHeight + 48}}px"><view class="stickyBar secondary">吸顶在导航下方 48px</view></mx-sticky><view class="block"><view class="blockItem" wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="*this" wx:if="{{index >= 6 && index < 12}}">{{item}}</view></view></view><view class="sectionGap"></view><wrap><title type="h2">感知是否吸顶</title><desc type="prop" text="check">check</desc><desc type="prop" text="bind:sticky_change">bind:sticky_change</desc></wrap><view class="cons"><mx-sticky top="{{navHeight}}px" check bind:sticky_change="handleStickyChange" ><view class="stickyBar success"><text>开启吸顶检测</text><text class="stickyStatus">{{stickyStatus ? '已吸顶' : '未吸顶'}}</text></view></mx-sticky><view class="block"><view class="blockItem" wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="*this" wx:if="{{index >= 12 && index < 18}}">{{item}}</view></view></view><view class="sectionGap"></view><wrap><title type="h2">透明头模式</title><desc type="prop" text="transparentTitle">transparentTitle</desc><desc type="prop" text="bind:get_header_height">自动计算导航高度：{{headerHeight}}px</desc></wrap><view class="cons"><mx-sticky transparentTitle bind:get_header_height="handleGetHeaderHeight" ><view class="stickyBar warn">自动吸附在导航栏下方</view></mx-sticky><view class="block"><view class="blockItem" wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="*this" wx:if="{{index >= 18}}">{{item}}</view></view></view><view class="sectionGap"></view><wrap><title type="h2">关闭吸顶</title><desc type="prop" text="sticky">sticky="{{false}}"</desc></wrap><view class="cons"><mx-sticky sticky="{{false}}"><view class="stickyBar" style="background:#656979;">不吸顶，随页面滚动</view></mx-sticky><view class="block"><view class="blockItem">关闭 sticky 后仅渲染插槽内容，不使用粘性定位</view><view class="blockItem">适合临时关闭吸顶能力的场景</view></view></view><view class="spacer"></view><line /><prop-table dataSource="{{propDocs}}" /></view> 